From: zhangzhaohong-dev <zhangzhaohong.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:49:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ignore comments when matching :empty

Port of https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz/pull/1747.

The baseline already skipped comments for :empty; this replaces that with upstream's rule (elements and non-empty text count), so empty text nodes no longer block a match. Code is in src/stylo.rs instead of src/stylo/dom.rs.
---
 src/stylo.rs | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/stylo.rs b/src/stylo.rs
index 9a5d837..02ef524 100644
--- a/src/stylo.rs
+++ b/src/stylo.rs
@@ -936,10 +936,11 @@ impl selectors::Element for BlitzNode<'_> {
     }
 
     fn is_empty(&self) -> bool {
-        // Per CSS Selectors Level 4 + WPT (matching Chrome/Firefox):
-        // comments do not count as content for `:empty`.
-        self.dom_children()
-            .all(|c| matches!(c.data, NodeData::Comment { .. }))
+        !self.dom_children().any(|child| match &child.data {
+            NodeData::Element(_) => true,
+            NodeData::Text(text) => !text.content.is_empty(),
+            _ => false,
+        })
     }
 
     fn is_root(&self) -> bool {
